+```md
+## How to update
+- If you haven't set up a remote, run the command `git remote add RHH https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion`.
+- Once you have your remote set up, run the command `git pull RHH expansion/1.17.2`.
+```
+
+
+## 🧬 General 🧬
+### Changed
+* Expansion 1.17.1 Release by @grintoul1 in [#10851](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10851)
+* Replace `Free` with `FREE_AND_SET_NULL` for sPokedexView by @AlexOn1ine in [#10984](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10984)
+
+### Fixed
+* Fix frontier trainer triggering dynamx or terastal unprompted by @FosterProgramming in [#10910](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10910)
+* Fix multiple bugs when generating mons by @FosterProgramming in [#10906](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10906)
+
+## 🗺️ Overworld 🗺️
+### Fixed
+* Fix player object init leaving "kind" uninitialized, leading to glitches in release by @Kraballa in [#10850](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10850)
+* Fix battle froniter ouside east doors by @FosterProgramming in [#10871](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10871)
+* Fix typo in `GiveParentSharedLevelUpMoves` by @FosterProgramming in [#10899](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10899)
+* fix close range trainer approach by @FosterProgramming in [#10890](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10890)
+* Fix wrong approach music for frlg encounters by @FosterProgramming in [#10849](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10849)
+    - Added three new "music styles" for trainers: Cute, Serious and Dangerous (they are used in frlg but can be added to your emerald game)
+    - FRLG trainers should play the correct them when they notice you
+    
+* fix(trainerbattle): unset `facePlayer` and set `continueScript` in `trainerbattle_two_trainers` by @miriamlefae in [#10936](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10936)
+* Fix to spinning running `SetMainCallback2(CB2_ReturnToField)` by @luuma in [#10887](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10887)   
+    
+* Fix approach music flag being set when it shouldn't be by @FosterProgramming in [#10950](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10950)
+* Fix recorded battle parties being corrupted by @grintoul1 in [#10596](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10596)
+* Add basic non-follower object support for `enter/exit_pokeball` by @mudskipper13 in [#10989](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10989)
+
+## 🐉 Pokémon 🐉
+### Changed
+* Overworld sprite touchups by @luuma in [#10931](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10931)
+
+## ⚔️ Battle General ⚔️
+### Fixed
+* Fix 2vs1 with single battler corrupting right battler slot healthbox by @grintoul1 in [#10866](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10866)
+* Fixes held items not being restored correctly after battle for wild mons by @AlexOn1ine in [#10878](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10878)
+* Safer `RandomPercentage` by @cawtds in [#10874](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10874)
+* Fix a potential crash downstream by @AlexOn1ine in [#10951](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10951)
+* fix(battle): decouple loop iterator reused as stringId in `Cmd_getexp` by @miriamlefae in [#10876](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10876)
+* Fix Flame/Toxic Orb wrong prevention by @AlexOn1ine in [#10974](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10974)
+* Fixes Strong Winds being applied on non flying type weaknesses by @AlexOn1ine in [#10972](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10972)
+* Fixes Cud Chew timer by @AlexOn1ine in [#10981](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10981)
+* Support `ITEM_USE_BATTLER` inside pyramid by @FosterProgramming in [#10553](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10553)
+* Fix terrain removal leaving the timer active by @Cle-bit in [#10996](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10996)
+* Fix Pledge combo turn order bounds checking by @Cle-bit in [#10997](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10997)
+* Fix unexpected Unseen Fist protection bypass message by @Cle-bit in [#10998](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10998)
+
+## 🧹 Other Cleanup 🧹
+* Updated How to New Pokémon with missing flags by @AsparagusEduardo in [#10790](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10790)
+
+## 🧪 Test Runner 🧪
+### Changed
+* Added tests for Grass Pelt and Surge Surfer. by @Sunset-Pink in [#10957](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10957)
+
+### Fixed
+* fix(test): Fix opp using wrong move when using certain `B_NATURE_POWER_MOVES` values by @purrfectdoodle in [#10971](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10971)
+
+## 📚 Documentation 📚
+* Updated How to New Pokémon with missing flags by @AsparagusEduardo in [#10790](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10790)
+* Small `forcesave` documentation by @RubyRaven6 in [#10987](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10987)
+
+## 👻 Sprites 👻
+### Changed
+* Add missing overworld sprites for many forms by @kittenchilly in [#10465](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10465)
+* Overworld sprite touchups by @luuma in [#10931](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10931)
+
+## New Contributors
+* @Kraballa made their first contribution in [#10850](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10850)
+* @Sunset-Pink made their first contribution in [#10957](https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/pull/10957)
+
+**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion/compare/expansion/1.17.1...expansion/1.17.2
+
