 # Smoke test: the opening, replayed
 
+## RC7 native UI profile
+
+`rc7_profile.replay` includes the unchanged opening/save/cold-Continue replay,
+then opens the summary skills page and cycles actual stats, numeric IVs and
+EVs. It uses expansion's existing debug menu on disposable data to enable the
+National Dex, mark entries for this UI test, and open the HGSS list and an
+entry. It does not change the game's normal progression or saved defaults.
+It also covers the two native sprite-sentinel guards needed by this UI.
+
+Run it with a fresh output directory, explicit save/RTC paths and a bounded
+headless invocation, for example:
+
+```
+mkdir -p build/rc7-profile
+TZ=UTC timeout 150 build/native64/pokeemerald-native --headless --silent --unthrottled --rtc-fixed 1700000000 --replay tests/smoke/rc7_profile.replay --out build/rc7-profile --save build/rc7-profile/test.sav --rtc-offset build/rc7-profile/test.rtc
+```
+
+The original opening dump and screenshot expectations remain unchanged.
+The added `rc7_*` screenshots document the existing UI, not replacement
+reference hashes that could conceal a regression.
+
 Gate (d). `opening.replay` drives the native build, headless and
 deterministic, from power-on through the opening of Pokemon Emerald and back
 from a cold restart: title, New Game, Professor Birch's speech, the truck,
diff --git a/tests/smoke/rc7_profile.replay b/tests/smoke/rc7_profile.replay
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..c6a9a3b927
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tests/smoke/rc7_profile.replay
@@ -0,0 +1,61 @@
+# RC7 native profile: existing normal opening, save and cold Continue, unchanged.
+include opening.replay
+wait 20
+# Continue resets the Start-menu cursor to the first available item, POKEMON.
+press START
+wait-until task_last=Task_ShowStartMenu max 120
+wait 10 # a key in the frame the menu opens is ignored
+press A
+wait-until task_last=Task_HandleChooseMonInput max 300
+wait 40 # party fade-in before choosing the lead
+press A
+wait-until task_last=Task_HandleSelectionMenuInput max 60
+press A
+wait-until task_first=Task_HandleInput max 300
+wait-until fade_active=1 max 30
+wait-until fade_active=0 max 120
+expect summary_species=252
+press RIGHT
+wait 40 # page slide and its graphics DMA
+screenshot rc7_summary_stats
+press A
+wait 20 # skills numbers redraw
+screenshot rc7_summary_ivs
+press A
+wait 20 # skills numbers redraw
+screenshot rc7_summary_evs
+# Returning from summary traverses the party fade and its selection menu.
+# Mash B so an input during a fade is not mistaken for a completed close.
+mash B until controls_locked=0 max 600
+wait 10
+# Use expansion's own debug APIs, on this disposable save only, to expose National Dex.
+hold R
+press START
+release R
+wait-until debug_menu_open=1 max 60
+wait 10 # debug list construction before navigating
+press DOWN times 8 # Flags & Vars
+press A
+wait-until task_last=DebugTask_HandleMenuInput_General max 60
+press DOWN times 4 # Toggle Pokedex
+press A
+press DOWN # Toggle National Dex (calls EnableNationalPokedex)
+press A
+press UP times 3 # Pokedex Flags All
+press A
+wait-until debug_menu_open=0 max 60
+wait-until controls_locked=0 max 120
+wait 10
+press START
+wait-until task_last=Task_ShowStartMenu max 120
+wait 10 # a key in the frame the menu opens is ignored
+press A # POKEDEX is now first
+wait-until callback2=CB2_Pokedex max 300
+wait-until task_first=Task_HandlePokedexInput max 300
+wait 30 # list fade and first sprites
+screenshot rc7_hgss_national_list
+dump rc7_hgss_national_list
+press A
+wait 120 # selected mon moves, then its information page loads
+screenshot rc7_hgss_entry
+dump rc7_hgss_entry
